@startuml
left to right direction

rectangle "Runtime" as runtime
rectangle "Sensor Handler" as sensor_handler
rectangle "State Store / Worker" as state
rectangle "State Replication Publisher" as publisher
rectangle "Heartbeat Runtime" as hb_runtime
rectangle "Peer Table" as peer_table
rectangle "Heartbeat Monitor (phi)" as hb_monitor
rectangle "Topology Store" as topology
rectangle "Introspection Service" as introspection
rectangle "API Clients" as api

runtime --> sensor_handler : manages
runtime --> state : manages
runtime --> publisher : manages
runtime --> hb_runtime : manages
runtime --> peer_table : manages
runtime --> topology : manages

sensor_handler --> state : local sensor events
publisher --> state : read replication deltas
publisher --> peer_table : select peers
hb_runtime --> peer_table : evaluate/update statuses
peer_table --> hb_monitor : owns detector
hb_runtime --> topology : mark connect/disconnect

state --> introspection : state snapshot
peer_table --> introspection : membership snapshot
topology --> introspection : topology snapshot
introspection --> api : read-only HTTP
@enduml
